<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Nouveau message de contact</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f5f5f5; margin: 0; padding: 0; color: #1a1a1a; }
        .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
        .header { background-color: #1a1a1a; padding: 24px 40px; }
        .header h1 { color: #c95f83; font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 0; }
        .header p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); font-size: 0.8rem; margin: 4px 0 0; }
        .body { padding: 32px 40px; }
        .alert { background: #fdf0f4; border-left: 4px solid #c95f83; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 24px; font-size: 0.95rem; }
        .section-title { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #c95f83; margin: 24px 0 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0; padding-bottom: 6px; }
        .info-box { background: #f9fafb; border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 16px; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .info-box strong { display: block; font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6b7280; margin-bottom: 4px; }
        .message-box { background: #f9fafb; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.8; white-space: pre-wrap; }
        .footer { background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 16px 40px; text-align: center; }
        .footer p { color: #9ca3af; font-size: 0.75rem; margin: 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>📩 Nouveau message de contact</h1>
            <p>Nice K'Cream Beauty — Site web</p>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
            <div class="alert">
                Message reçu le <strong>{{ contact.createdAt|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}</strong>
            </div>

            <p class="section-title">Coordonnées</p>
            <div class="info-box">
                <strong>Nom</strong>{{ contact.nom }}
            </div>
            <div class="info-box">
                <strong>Email</strong>
                <a href="mailto:{{ contact.email }}">{{ contact.email }}</a>
            </div>
            <div class="info-box">
                <strong>Sujet</strong>{{ contact.sujet }}
            </div>

            <p class="section-title">Message</p>
            <div class="message-box">{{ contact.message }}</div>

            <p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:#6b7280; margin-top:24px;">
                💡 Vous pouvez répondre directement à cet email pour contacter {{ contact.nom }}.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Email automatique — Nice K'Cream Beauty</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>